ui-screens/app-logic.md:260:- **Keyboard type (B-18, Round 4):** notes fields (Chief complaints, Doctor notes, Additional instructions) open the text keyboard. The Other dose field keeps the number pad with a decimal key, and its error shows a mistake a doctor can really make on that pad.
