| Table | Rows | Use |
|---|---|---|
| `medicine_molecule` | 222,807 | product_code → molecule_code |
| `medicine_master` | 231,012 | One row per product (typos: `consider_poduct`, `keep_orginal`) |
| `medicine_warehouse_master` | 8,063,217 | Product × warehouse overrides |
